{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Create a premium fully responsive “Core Values” section for a modern supplement ecommerce Shopify store.
    
    --------------------------------------------------
    SECTION GOAL
    --------------------------------------------------
    
    Design a clean, modern, trust-building values/features section similar to premium international supplement brands.
    
    The section should communicate:
    - Brand trust
    - Product quality
    - Scientific credibility
    - Customer-focused approach
    
    The design should feel:
    - Premium
    - Minimal
    - Scientific
    - Elegant
    - Modern ecommerce focused
    
    --------------------------------------------------
    SECTION LAYOUT
    --------------------------------------------------
    
    Desktop:
    - Centered section heading
    - 4-column card layout
    - Equal height cards
    - Spacious clean spacing
    - Soft premium UI
    
    Tablet:
    - 2-column grid
    
    Mobile:
    - Single column stacked cards
    OR
    - Horizontal swipe carousel option
    
    No horizontal overflow allowed.
    
    --------------------------------------------------
    SECTION HEADER
    --------------------------------------------------
    
    Add dynamic editable heading.
    
    Example:
    OUR CORE VALUES
    
    Support:
    - Multi-color heading text
    - Highlight specific words
    Example:
    OUR CORE <orange>VALUES</orange>
    
    Merchant should be able to:
    - Change heading
    - Change highlighted text color
    - Change alignment
    - Change heading size
    
    --------------------------------------------------
    VALUE CARDS
    --------------------------------------------------
    
    Create dynamic repeatable value cards.
    
    Each card should include:
    
    1. Selectable Icon
    2. Title
    3. Description
    
    Example cards:
    - Science Backed
    - Premium Quality
    - Results Driven
    - Customer First
    
    --------------------------------------------------
    ICON REQUIREMENTS
    --------------------------------------------------
    
    IMPORTANT:
    Icons MUST be selectable.
    
    Merchant should be able to:
    - Select/change icon
    - Upload custom SVG icon
    - Upload PNG icon
    - Change icon size
    - Change icon color
    - Change icon background color
    - Change icon circle size
    
    Use:
    - Shopify image picker
    OR
    - Icon selector system
    
    Card icon area should:
    - Be circular
    - Have soft background
    - Premium clean appearance
    
    --------------------------------------------------
    CARD CUSTOMIZATION
    --------------------------------------------------
    
    Merchant must be able to:
    - Add/remove cards
    - Reorder cards
    - Change title
    - Change description
    - Change icon
    - Change card background
    - Change border radius
    - Change hover effect
    
    Use Shopify blocks for cards.
    
    --------------------------------------------------
    DESIGN STYLE
    --------------------------------------------------
    
    Color palette:
    - Primary Blue: #0B2C6B
    - Accent Orange: #FF6A00
    - Light Background: #F7F9FC
    - Border Color: #E5E7EB
    
    Typography:
    - Bold modern heading
    - Clean readable descriptions
    - Strong spacing hierarchy
    
    Card Style:
    - Rounded corners
    - Thin subtle border
    - Soft shadow on hover
    - Minimal premium UI
    - Spacious padding
    
    --------------------------------------------------
    HOVER EFFECTS
    --------------------------------------------------
    
    Add premium subtle hover effects:
    - Slight card lift
    - Soft shadow increase
    - Icon scale animation
    - Smooth transitions
    
    Animations should:
    - Be lightweight
    - Feel modern
    - Maintain performance
    
    --------------------------------------------------
    RESPONSIVE REQUIREMENTS
    --------------------------------------------------
    
    The section MUST:
    - Be fully responsive
    - Work perfectly on all screen sizes
    - Maintain equal spacing
    - Prevent text overflow
    - Prevent horizontal scrolling
    
    Mobile optimizations:
    - Smaller icon sizes
    - Reduced padding
    - Proper text wrapping
    - Smooth stacked layout
    
    --------------------------------------------------
    SHOPIFY REQUIREMENTS
    --------------------------------------------------
    
    Build using:
    - Shopify Liquid
    - CSS
    - Minimal JavaScript
    
    Requirements:
    - Dawn theme compatible
    - Theme editor customizable
    - Semantic HTML
    - Performance optimized
    - Reusable architecture
    - Dynamic Shopify schema
    
    --------------------------------------------------
    CUSTOMIZATION OPTIONS
    --------------------------------------------------
    
    Merchant should be able to customize:
    - Section background color
    - Card background color
    - Card border radius
    - Card spacing
    - Text colors
    - Icon colors
    - Hover effects
    - Section padding
    - Grid columns
    - Mobile layout style
    
    --------------------------------------------------
    ADVANCED OPTIONS
    --------------------------------------------------
    
    Add optional settings:
    - Enable/disable hover animations
    - Enable card shadows
    - Enable glassmorphism effect
    - Enable gradient backgrounds
    - Enable carousel on mobile
    
    --------------------------------------------------
    FINAL GOAL
    --------------------------------------------------
    
    The final section should look like a premium supplement brand feature/value section with elegant cards, selectable icons, clean spacing, and fully customizable Shopify editor support.
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}

{% style %}
  .ai-core-values-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    padding: {{ block.settings.section_padding_top }}px 20px {{ block.settings.section_padding_bottom }}px;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.section_background }};
  }

  .ai-core-values-container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    max-width: {{ block.settings.container_width }}px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .ai-core-values-header-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    text-align: {{ block.settings.heading_alignment }};
    margin-bottom: {{ block.settings.heading_spacing }}px;
  }

  .ai-core-values-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.heading_size }}px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: {{ block.settings.heading_color }};
    margin: 0;
    line-height: 1.2;
  }

  .ai-core-values-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} .highlight {
    color: {{ block.settings.heading_highlight_color }};
  }

  .ai-core-values-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat({{ block.settings.desktop_columns }}, 1fr);
    gap: {{ block.settings.card_gap }}px;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
  }

  .ai-core-values-card-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    background-color: {{ block.settings.card_background }};
    border: {{ block.settings.card_border_width }}px solid {{ block.settings.card_border_color }};
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.card_border_radius }}px;
    padding: {{ block.settings.card_padding }}px;
    text-align: center;
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
    {% if block.settings.enable_card_shadow %}
      box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
    {% endif %}
  }

  {% if block.settings.enable_hover_effects %}
    .ai-core-values-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover {
      transform: translateY(-8px);
      {% if block.settings.enable_card_shadow %}
        box-shadow: 0 12px 24px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.12);
      {% endif %}
    }
  {% endif %}

  .ai-core-values-icon-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: {{ block.settings.icon_circle_size }}px;
    height: {{ block.settings.icon_circle_size }}px;
    margin: 0 auto {{ block.settings.icon_spacing }}px;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.icon_background }};
    border-radius: 50%;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    transition: transform 0.3s ease;
  }

  {% if block.settings.enable_hover_effects %}
    .ai-core-values-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover .ai-core-values-icon-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      transform: scale(1.1);
    }
  {% endif %}

  .ai-core-values-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: {{ block.settings.icon_size }}px;
    height: {{ block.settings.icon_size }}px;
    object-fit: contain;
  }

  .ai-core-values-icon-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: {{ block.settings.icon_size }}px;
    height: {{ block.settings.icon_size }}px;
  }

  .ai-core-values-icon-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }} svg {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    fill: {{ block.settings.icon_color }};
  }

  .ai-core-values-card-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.card_title_size }}px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: {{ block.settings.card_title_color }};
    margin: 0 0 {{ block.settings.title_spacing }}px;
    line-height: 1.3;
  }

  .ai-core-values-card-description-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.card_description_size }}px;
    color: {{ block.settings.card_description_color }};
    margin: 0;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .ai-core-values-empty-state-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    text-align: center;
    padding: 60px 20px;
    color: #666;
    font-size: 16px;
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 989px) {
    .ai-core-values-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      grid-template-columns: repeat({{ block.settings.tablet_columns }}, 1fr);
    }

    .ai-core-values-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: calc({{ block.settings.heading_size }}px * 0.8);
    }
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 749px) {
    .ai-core-values-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding: {{ block.settings.section_padding_top | times: 0.6 }}px 16px {{ block.settings.section_padding_bottom | times: 0.6 }}px;
    }

    {% if block.settings.mobile_layout == 'stack' %}
      .ai-core-values-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }
    {% elsif block.settings.mobile_layout == 'carousel' %}
      .ai-core-values-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
        display: flex;
        overflow-x: auto;
        scroll-snap-type: x mandatory;
        gap: 16px;
        padding-bottom: 16px;
        -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch;
      }

      .ai-core-values-card-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
        min-width: 280px;
        scroll-snap-align: start;
      }

      .ai-core-values-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }}::-webkit-scrollbar {
        height: 6px;
      }

      .ai-core-values-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }}::-webkit-scrollbar-track {
        background: #f1f1f1;
        border-radius: 10px;
      }

      .ai-core-values-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }}::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb {
        background: #888;
        border-radius: 10px;
      }
    {% endif %}

    .ai-core-values-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: calc({{ block.settings.heading_size }}px * 0.6);
    }

    .ai-core-values-icon-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      width: calc({{ block.settings.icon_circle_size }}px * 0.8);
      height: calc({{ block.settings.icon_circle_size }}px * 0.8);
    }

    .ai-core-values-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      width: calc({{ block.settings.icon_size }}px * 0.8);
      height: calc({{ block.settings.icon_size }}px * 0.8);
    }

    .ai-core-values-icon-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      width: calc({{ block.settings.icon_size }}px * 0.8);
      height: calc({{ block.settings.icon_size }}px * 0.8);
    }

    .ai-core-values-card-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding: calc({{ block.settings.card_padding }}px * 0.8);
    }

    .ai-core-values-card-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: calc({{ block.settings.card_title_size }}px * 0.9);
    }

    .ai-core-values-card-description-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: calc({{ block.settings.card_description_size }}px * 0.9);
    }
  }
{% endstyle %}

<core-values-{{ ai_gen_id }} class="ai-core-values-{{ ai_gen_id }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
  <div class="ai-core-values-container-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
    {% if block.settings.heading != blank %}
      <div class="ai-core-values-header-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        <h2 class="ai-core-values-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          {{ block.settings.heading }}
        </h2>
      </div>
    {% endif %}

    <ul class="ai-core-values-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
      {% if block.settings.card_1_enabled %}
        <li class="ai-core-values-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          <div class="ai-core-values-icon-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            {% if block.settings.card_1_icon != blank %}
              <img
                src="{{ block.settings.card_1_icon | image_url: width: 200 }}"
                alt="{{ block.settings.card_1_title | escape }}"
                class="ai-core-values-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
                loading="lazy"
                width="200"
                height="200"
              >
            {% else %}
              <div class="ai-core-values-icon-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                {{ 'image' | placeholder_svg_tag }}
              </div>
            {% endif %}
          </div>

          {% if block.settings.card_1_title != blank %}
            <h3 class="ai-core-values-card-title-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              {{ block.settings.card_1_title }}
            </h3>
          {% endif %}

          {% if block.settings.card_1_description != blank %}
            <p class="ai-core-values-card-description-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              {{ block.settings.card_1_description }}
            </p>
          {% endif %}
        </li>
      {% endif %}

      {% if block.settings.card_2_enabled %}
        <li class="ai-core-values-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          <div class="ai-core-values-icon-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            {% if block.settings.card_2_icon != blank %}
              <img
                src="{{ block.settings.card_2_icon | image_url: width: 200 }}"
                alt="{{ block.settings.card_2_title | escape }}"
                class="ai-core-values-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
                loading="lazy"
                width="200"
                height="200"
              >
            {% else %}
              <div class="ai-core-values-icon-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                {{ 'image' | placeholder_svg_tag }}
              </div>
            {% endif %}
          </div>

          {% if block.settings.card_2_title != blank %}
            <h3 class="ai-core-values-card-title-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              {{ block.settings.card_2_title }}
            </h3>
          {% endif %}

          {% if block.settings.card_2_description != blank %}
            <p class="ai-core-values-card-description-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              {{ block.settings.card_2_description }}
            </p>
          {% endif %}
        </li>
      {% endif %}

      {% if block.settings.card_3_enabled %}
        <li class="ai-core-values-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          <div class="ai-core-values-icon-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            {% if block.settings.card_3_icon != blank %}
              <img
                src="{{ block.settings.card_3_icon | image_url: width: 200 }}"
                alt="{{ block.settings.card_3_title | escape }}"
                class="ai-core-values-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
                loading="lazy"
                width="200"
                height="200"
              >
            {% else %}
              <div class="ai-core-values-icon-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                {{ 'image' | placeholder_svg_tag }}
              </div>
            {% endif %}
          </div>

          {% if block.settings.card_3_title != blank %}
            <h3 class="ai-core-values-card-title-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              {{ block.settings.card_3_title }}
            </h3>
          {% endif %}

          {% if block.settings.card_3_description != blank %}
            <p class="ai-core-values-card-description-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              {{ block.settings.card_3_description }}
            </p>
          {% endif %}
        </li>
      {% endif %}

      {% if block.settings.card_4_enabled %}
        <li class="ai-core-values-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          <div class="ai-core-values-icon-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            {% if block.settings.card_4_icon != blank %}
              <img
                src="{{ block.settings.card_4_icon | image_url: width: 200 }}"
                alt="{{ block.settings.card_4_title | escape }}"
                class="ai-core-values-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
                loading="lazy"
                width="200"
                height="200"
              >
            {% else %}
              <div class="ai-core-values-icon-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                {{ 'image' | placeholder_svg_tag }}
              </div>
            {% endif %}
          </div>

          {% if block.settings.card_4_title != blank %}
            <h3 class="ai-core-values-card-title-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              {{ block.settings.card_4_title }}
            </h3>
          {% endif %}

          {% if block.settings.card_4_description != blank %}
            <p class="ai-core-values-card-description-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              {{ block.settings.card_4_description }}
            </p>
          {% endif %}
        </li>
      {% endif %}
    </ul>
  </div>
</core-values-{{ ai_gen_id }}>

<script>
  (function() {
    class CoreValues{{ ai_gen_id }} extends HTMLElement {
      constructor() {
        super();
      }

      connectedCallback() {
        this.processHighlightedText();
      }

      processHighlightedText() {
        const heading = this.querySelector('.ai-core-values-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }}');
        if (!heading) return;

        let html = heading.innerHTML;
        html = html.replace(/<orange>(.*?)<\/orange>/gi, '<span class="highlight">$1</span>');
        html = html.replace(/<highlight>(.*?)<\/highlight>/gi, '<span class="highlight">$1</span>');
        heading.innerHTML = html;
      }
    }

    customElements.define('core-values-{{ ai_gen_id }}', CoreValues{{ ai_gen_id }});
  })();
</script>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Core values",
  "tag": null,
  "class": "section",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Section heading"
    },
    {
      "type": "inline_richtext",
      "id": "heading",
      "label": "Heading",
      "default": "OUR CORE VALUES",
      "info": "Use <orange>text</orange> or <highlight>text</highlight> to highlight words"
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "heading_size",
      "label": "Heading size",
      "min": 24,
      "max": 72,
      "step": 2,
      "unit": "px",
      "default": 48
    },
    {
      "type": "select",
      "id": "heading_alignment",
      "label": "Heading alignment",
      "options": [
        {
          "value": "left",
          "label": "Left"
        },
        {
          "value": "center",
          "label": "Center"
        },
        {
          "value": "right",
          "label": "Right"
        }
      ],
      "default": "center"
    },
    {
      "type": "color",
      "id": "heading_color",
      "label": "Heading color",
      "default": "#0B2C6B"
    },
    {
      "type": "color",
      "id": "heading_highlight_color",
      "label": "Highlight color",
      "default": "#FF6A00"
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "heading_spacing",
      "label": "Spacing below heading",
      "min": 20,
      "max": 80,
      "step": 4,
      "unit": "px",
      "default": 48
